<title>USA: Hamilton County, Tenn., $53 mln won by Lehman.</title>
<headline>Hamilton County, Tenn., $53 mln won by Lehman.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers said it won $53 million of Hamilton County, Tenn., general obligation bonds, Series 1997 A, with a true interest cost of 5.10 percent.</p>
</text>
